This directory is intended for PlatformIO unit tests.

Unit tests are written with the Unity framework (configured in platformio.ini).

To run the tests on the target hardware:

    pio test -e weact_g474ceu6

Test files are discovered by matching `test_*` — e.g. `test/test_measure/test_measure.c`.

Tests requiring hardware (the DUT socket, front-end switches, ADC) must be
guarded so they only run when the fixture is attached; pure maths — the fusion
scoring, median gate, τ fit and calibration solvers — should run standalone.

This directory is empty until the measurement code exists.